The people in the 20-30's said they watch the news or dramas on their cell phones as well as do internet shopping or online banking. They also said they like taking pictures and uploading them onto their blogs.

The elderly people answered differently from the people in their 20-30's and said they use their cell phones mostly for making calls or sending text messages. They said that because there are many times they need to make calculations for the prices of products, it was convenient to use the cell phone to calculate. They answered that when they occasionally search the internet, it was uncomfortable because the text was too small.

