People over 40 enjoy hiking as their hobby the most while people in their 20's enjoy listening to music the most. But for those in their 20's, they watch movies as much as they listen to music. They say that when they are alone, they listen to music a lot and when they are with friends, they watch a lot of movies.

Then what kind of movies do Koreans like? The movie genre that Koreans like the most is action movies (26%). Twenty percent like science fiction, 12% like drama, and 10% prefer romantic comedies.

Men of all ages like action movies the most and watch them often. Action movies were also the favorite for women. Although most women like action movies, teenagers liked romantic comedies more than action.

